  "notes": [
   "The catalog prints a summary: Completion of Music Studies - Level I Coursework 15-18 units PLUS Completion of Music Studies Level II - Performance Coursework 15-17 units; Total Units 30-35. The Level I subtotal spans the first two blocks, and the Level II subtotal spans the remaining blocks.",
   "The Level II coursework subheading is printed as 'Completion of Music Studies Level II - Jazz Coursework' even though this is the Performance certificate. This may be a catalog error; please check.",
   "MUS 160 is printed as '(.5 unit course. 1 unit required)' with 1 unit beside it, so it is recorded at 1 unit. The student takes 1 unit of the 0.5-unit course.",
   "The MUS 171 row carries the parenthetical '(Choose two electives (three units minimum))', which looks like a display artifact.",
   "The Level I elective rule is 'Choose two electives (three units minimum)', printed 3-6. It is recorded as choose_courses 2. A three-unit minimum also applies.",
   "The catalog prints 'MUS 31' (Concert Choir). The closed list stores it as 'MUS31', so it is treated as the same closed-list course and is not an addition.",
   "The piano pathway is printed as 'MUS 172 & MUS 173 ... 2 Or MUS 172J & MUS 173J'. It is recorded as two option blocks in option_group 'Piano pathway'. The 2 units are printed beside the MUS 172/173 pair only, and no per-course units are printed. A correction note dated 9/9/26 says the piano display was updated to clarify the two pathways.",
   "In the catalog, MUS 261A and MUS 261B are printed after the piano pathway rows. They are grouped here with the other required Level II courses.",
   "The ensemble list does not print units beside its courses, so those course units are null.",
   "The Outcomes tab prints the heading 'Program Learning Objectives' and a link to 'Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program.' No outcomes are printed, so the outcomes list is empty.",
   "Many codes in the section are absent from the closed list and are flagged as catalog additions: MUS 120, 145, 172, 173, 172J, 173J, 261A, 261B, 29, 29B, 31B, 34, 36, 38, 44B, 45B, 49B."
  ]
